  "intro_message": "LANTERN VALE: THE BELL OF DAWN\n\nNo bell has welcomed the sunrise in a hundred days. You arrive in Dawnmere with empty hands. Mara waits at the north end of the road; walk to her, gather supplies, and begin your journey.",
  "instructions_message": "Arrows / WASD move. F attacks in the last direction moved. I opens inventory: equip gear, use items, or drop them on clear ground. Walk away and back to recover dropped items. Bottom slots (1\u20135) use equipped items. Period waits. Walk onto people, items and landmarks to activate their triggers. Blocked moves also take a turn. Save from the Game menu. If your health reaches zero, you can restart.",
  "game_end_message": "The dawn returns to Lantern Vale."
}